        "value": "Clash Horse · Sha South;Clash Goat · Sha East;Clash Monkey · Sha North;Clash Rooster · Sha West;Clash Dog · Sha South;Clash Pig · Sha East;Clash Rat · Sha North;Clash Ox · Sha West;Clash Tiger · Sha South;Clash Rabbit · Sha East;Clash Dragon · Sha North;Clash Snake · Sha West"
      },
      "_note": "英文冲煞写全方位词(原「Sha W」读不懂,2026-10-08)"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "JQA",
        "value": "$[split::(index::(split::(${JQ},~),calc::(${y}-2020)),_)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t1",
        "value": "$[index::(${JQA},calc::(2*${m}-2))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mb",
        "value": "$[round::(if::(ge::(${tdn},${t1}),calc::(${m}-floor::(calc::((${m})/12))*12),calc::(calc::(${m}-1)-floor::(calc::((calc::(${m}-1))/12))*12)))]"
      },
      "_note": "月支:节当天即换月(宜忌表的键就按这个口径采样,1950–2050 零冲突)"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "di",
        "value": "$[round::(calc::(calc::(${tdn}+17)-floor::(calc::((calc::(${tdn}+17))/60))*60))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "key",
        "value": "$[connect::(index::(${ZHI},${mb}),index::(${GAN},calc::(${di}-floor::(calc::((${di})/10))*10)),index::(${ZHI},calc::(${di}-floor::(calc::((${di})/12))*12)))]"
      }
    },
